WEBVTT

01:24.960 --> 01:27.280
ADAPTED FROM THE LEGEND
OF KUNSHAN JADE BY TAN TIANYIN

01:34.680 --> 01:35.800
Why are you bringing me here again?

01:37.520 --> 01:38.880
Didn't you say you liked it here
during the day?

01:38.960 --> 01:40.280
So,

01:40.360 --> 01:41.720
I had Kang Ju

01:41.800 --> 01:42.800
buy the whole place for us.

01:44.160 --> 01:46.120
-Bought it all?
-Do you like it?

01:47.840 --> 01:48.760
I do.

01:49.960 --> 01:51.680
They'll say I'm bullying you again.

01:53.720 --> 01:54.560
Only you can bully me.

01:58.280 --> 01:59.440
Wait a moment.

02:08.520 --> 02:10.560
You pinned a flower in my hair today.

02:11.480 --> 02:12.320
Let me return the favor.

02:13.800 --> 02:14.840
Okay.

02:32.480 --> 02:33.640
It's not easy to pin.

02:39.240 --> 02:40.080
Well…

02:40.600 --> 02:43.320
At night, the streets
of Bianjing are completely empty.

02:45.400 --> 02:47.640
It's so late, of course, there's no one.

02:51.400 --> 02:53.280
The… The moon isn't out either.

02:54.680 --> 02:56.360
-Yeah, no moon.
-Right.

02:56.440 --> 02:57.320
It's just you and me.

03:09.520 --> 03:10.400
What's wrong?

03:10.920 --> 03:13.240
-Did you bump into something?
-No… it's nothing.

03:13.320 --> 03:15.600
Here? Does it hurt?

03:17.800 --> 03:18.920
-Does it hurt anymore?
-Duanwu.

03:20.720 --> 03:22.360
Can I kiss you?

03:53.520 --> 03:54.560
I'll think about it…

07:01.560 --> 07:02.640
So this is the great desert.

07:10.200 --> 07:11.120
Mr. Cao.

07:12.560 --> 07:14.960
Grab him!

07:15.040 --> 07:17.080
-Shrimp!
-Be careful, you guys!

07:17.160 --> 07:18.040
Stop!

07:20.000 --> 07:21.200
It looks like someone lives over there.

07:22.240 --> 07:23.280
Okay.

07:23.360 --> 07:25.120
Tonight, we'll set up camp over there.

07:38.400 --> 07:39.840
So, this is what home feels like.

07:40.960 --> 07:42.040
It's so nice.

07:45.120 --> 07:46.440
We can have a home too.

07:51.920 --> 07:52.760
We can?

07:53.880 --> 07:56.520
Of course. How about it?

08:00.840 --> 08:02.000
Then it's settled.

08:05.240 --> 08:06.880
I once heard a story in the desert.

08:08.560 --> 08:10.080
In the vast desert,

08:10.160 --> 08:11.080
there's a purple star.

08:11.160 --> 08:13.840
It was once a wandering star
in the desert,

08:14.760 --> 08:16.440
until it met another wandering star

08:16.520 --> 08:18.280
above the Lake Zijing.

08:18.360 --> 08:20.640
From then on, they stopped wandering.

08:20.720 --> 08:22.160
The two stars stayed together every day.

08:22.800 --> 08:24.760
They say that as long as two lovers

08:24.840 --> 08:26.040
stand beneath Mount Zijing

08:26.120 --> 08:28.280
and witness the meeting of the two stars,

08:28.360 --> 08:30.240
they will be lifelong lovers.

08:33.280 --> 08:34.120
So,

08:35.480 --> 08:37.840
I want to take you there. Is that okay?

08:40.039 --> 08:42.600
Do you really believe in the purple stars,

08:42.679 --> 08:44.840
and if two people see them,

08:44.920 --> 08:46.000
they'll stay together?

08:46.080 --> 08:47.200
That's just a story for kids.

08:47.800 --> 08:50.240
Before, I didn't believe it either,
but now…

08:53.160 --> 08:54.440
I want to believe.

08:59.160 --> 09:00.120
Alright.

09:01.640 --> 09:02.640
Well then,

09:03.440 --> 09:06.200
if you believe, I'll believe too.

09:14.920 --> 09:17.680
How about
I make some purple star bracelets

09:18.440 --> 09:19.880
and then we wear them together

09:19.960 --> 09:22.200
to see the purple stars at Lake Zijing?

09:24.160 --> 09:25.320
Sure.

09:28.200 --> 09:29.280
Then it's settled.

09:43.880 --> 09:48.000
LANGHUAN DOCKYARD

10:01.240 --> 10:02.440
Come and look.

10:28.520 --> 10:30.120
Look, there it is.

10:47.760 --> 10:49.040
Shrimp.

10:49.120 --> 10:50.000
Duanwu,

10:50.520 --> 10:53.120
is Langhuan Dockyard
nestled in these mountains

10:53.200 --> 10:54.760
like a pearl farm?

10:54.840 --> 10:56.560
No, it's underground.

10:57.240 --> 10:59.280
This place
used to be crawling with bandits,

10:59.360 --> 11:00.280
so the Master of Langhuan Dockyard

11:00.360 --> 11:02.040
built an underground city here.

11:02.120 --> 11:04.960
Unexpectedly, it became a trade hub
between the Western Regions and Tang.

11:05.800 --> 11:07.920
You could call it a sanctuary.

11:17.200 --> 11:19.360
Master Yan,
Master Yuchi invites you inside.

11:19.960 --> 11:20.960
Please, lead the way.

11:23.040 --> 11:24.160
Let's head in.

11:25.360 --> 11:27.000
Kang Ju, take care of the convoy.

11:52.080 --> 11:53.400
Shrimp, look at that!

11:53.480 --> 11:54.400
-Have you ever seen anything like it?
-Look at this one.

11:55.000 --> 11:56.360
-So pretty.
-Keep up.

11:56.440 --> 11:57.600
Take a look.

11:58.640 --> 11:59.800
Take a look!

12:05.680 --> 12:06.560
So beautiful!

12:08.880 --> 12:11.560
Come take a look! Silver necklaces!

12:13.040 --> 12:14.480
Sparkling necklaces!

12:15.080 --> 12:16.440
Boy, have some roast chicken!

12:16.520 --> 12:17.720
Loud!

12:17.800 --> 12:19.560
-Loud!
-Fragrant roast chicken!

12:19.640 --> 12:20.600
Take a look!

12:20.680 --> 12:21.960
Stop sniffing.
If you want it, just buy it.

12:22.040 --> 12:23.320
-Just buy it.
-Yes.

12:23.400 --> 12:24.560
-Let's buy one.
-Shrimp,

12:24.640 --> 12:26.160
there are so many tasty treats over there.
Let's go!

12:26.840 --> 12:28.320
-Wait for me!
-Be careful!

12:28.840 --> 12:30.040
Go have fun with them.

12:30.920 --> 12:32.120
Shrimp, wait up!

12:33.800 --> 12:35.960
-What's this?
-Here, look at our pearls!

12:36.040 --> 12:37.800
Take a look! Here are our pearls.

12:37.880 --> 12:40.080
-These are pearls from Persia.
-Persian pearls.

12:40.160 --> 12:41.480
Made into jewelry,

12:41.560 --> 12:43.040
they'd be perfect on you.

12:43.760 --> 12:46.240
We also have gemstones.

12:47.600 --> 12:49.640
This one is ruby.

12:50.280 --> 12:51.480
Ruby?

12:55.320 --> 12:56.560
Thank you.

12:56.640 --> 12:57.680
-Take another look.
-Don't you like it?

12:57.760 --> 12:58.600
We have others.

12:59.120 --> 13:00.160
Thank you.

13:01.320 --> 13:03.200
Look at our gemstones!

13:07.720 --> 13:10.160
Hello. Is this crystal?

13:10.240 --> 13:12.640
-No.
-It's glass. It's kiln-fired.

13:13.200 --> 13:14.680
Kiln-fired glass?

13:15.640 --> 13:16.920
So clear and bright.

13:18.640 --> 13:20.240
-Let me see.
-Sure, take a look.

13:20.320 --> 13:21.160
See here,

13:21.760 --> 13:22.800
under the light,

13:22.880 --> 13:24.760
you can see the traces from firing.

13:27.480 --> 13:28.640
So beautiful.

13:29.240 --> 13:30.640
The craft of kiln-firing glass
is difficult.

13:31.720 --> 13:34.080
But back in the day, our Yan family
had quite the reputation

13:34.160 --> 13:35.320
for our glass-making skills,

13:35.840 --> 13:36.760
famous near and far.

13:36.840 --> 13:40.480
-You know how to make it?
-I, of course… don't know.

13:41.080 --> 13:42.320
But I watched them make it
when I was little.

13:42.400 --> 13:44.960
Maybe we can study it together sometime.

13:50.240 --> 13:51.280
Thank you.

13:51.800 --> 13:52.640
Not buying one?

13:52.720 --> 13:55.000
-No need. Why would we buy that?
-Alright. Thank you.

13:57.200 --> 14:01.240
Nuts! Big, fragrant, and crunchy nuts!

14:01.960 --> 14:03.440
Nuts!

14:03.520 --> 14:05.040
-Nuts!
-Sir, buy some nuts!

14:05.120 --> 14:06.640
Big, fragrant, and crunchy!

14:08.080 --> 14:08.920
We just finished the nuts

14:09.000 --> 14:10.640
-we bought last time.
-Here you go.

14:10.720 --> 14:12.200
I didn't expect to find them here too.

14:12.280 --> 14:13.760
How abut we buy some here?

14:13.840 --> 14:15.920
Get as many as you want.
After all, the Master is treating.

14:16.800 --> 14:18.480
Yes, let's get them!

14:19.280 --> 14:20.640
I'll take this bag.

14:21.440 --> 14:23.320
-This one's good. This one's the best!
-Okay.

14:25.040 --> 14:26.400
We'll take them all!

14:26.480 --> 14:27.760
Got it! Thank you, sir!

14:29.000 --> 14:30.440
-How much?
-A hundred and fifty cash.

14:30.520 --> 14:31.480
A hundred…

14:36.160 --> 14:37.400
A hundred and fifty cash.

14:38.040 --> 14:39.480
That's not too pricey,

14:39.560 --> 14:41.200
just a bit more than in Guangzhou.

14:46.240 --> 14:47.920
-Thank you, sir.
-Thank you, Accountant Wei.

14:48.000 --> 14:49.880
Let's go enjoy some wine and meat.

14:49.960 --> 14:52.680
With these nuts as a side,
it'll be perfect.

14:52.760 --> 14:53.600
We just got here,

14:53.680 --> 14:55.040
and there's still a lot of business
to handle.

14:55.840 --> 14:56.680
Let's move on.

14:57.640 --> 15:00.400
Miss, the Master is treating!

15:01.520 --> 15:02.720
Just listen to Accountant Wei.

15:02.800 --> 15:04.040
Trust her.

15:05.400 --> 15:06.280
That's right.

15:06.360 --> 15:08.040
Trusting her is always the right call.

15:09.240 --> 15:11.160
Accountant Wei, try these nuts.

15:11.720 --> 15:13.760
They're really good.

15:15.360 --> 15:16.360
Look at these nuts,

15:16.440 --> 15:18.680
full and crisp with every bite,

15:18.760 --> 15:20.640
perfect for snacking while you're working

15:20.720 --> 15:22.000
on the books.

15:23.160 --> 15:24.080
Thank you.

15:26.120 --> 15:27.440
And look at these walnuts,

15:28.040 --> 15:29.240
good color, full meat.

15:29.840 --> 15:31.440
When you're up late doing accounts,

15:31.520 --> 15:32.920
they're perfect to fuel up with, right?

15:37.040 --> 15:38.000
What's that supposed to mean?

15:38.080 --> 15:39.240
Are you saying I'm slow at doing accounts?

15:41.200 --> 15:42.320
Don't worry,

15:42.400 --> 15:44.760
I remember your accounts very well.

15:45.400 --> 15:46.560
You're the one
who should boost your brain.

15:47.880 --> 15:49.240
Well, I mean…

15:51.040 --> 15:52.800
If I didn't owe the convoy money,

15:52.880 --> 15:54.000
I wouldn't even bother with you!

16:00.760 --> 16:04.200
WUYI RESIDENCE

16:12.520 --> 16:13.360
Yuchi!

16:14.560 --> 16:15.680
Long time no see!

16:26.920 --> 16:28.520
I hear you've made something of yourself,

16:28.600 --> 16:29.680
got your own trading convoy now.

16:29.760 --> 16:30.800
Hardly.

16:30.880 --> 16:32.040
These are just small trades.

16:32.120 --> 16:34.440
How could they compare
to the grand setup you have here?

16:36.760 --> 16:37.760
And this is?

16:37.840 --> 16:39.040
Come on.
Let me introduce you to each other.

16:39.120 --> 16:40.520
This is Master Yuchi.

16:40.600 --> 16:41.720
This is Duanwu.

16:43.280 --> 16:44.400
Your girlfriend?

16:45.800 --> 16:48.360
With you by his side, I feel relieved.

16:49.240 --> 16:50.560
If he ever bullies you,

16:50.640 --> 16:52.240
just let me know,
and I'll set him straight!

16:55.920 --> 16:57.120
Greetings, Master Yuchi.

17:00.480 --> 17:01.680
Miss Duanwu,

17:02.480 --> 17:04.079
why do you look so familiar?

17:04.680 --> 17:05.920
Have we met somewhere before?

17:10.480 --> 17:11.720
We shouldn't have.

17:12.480 --> 17:14.359
I was in Hepu before,

17:15.079 --> 17:18.160
then I joined the convoy,
following him all the way.

17:18.240 --> 17:19.079
We would've had no chance to meet--

17:19.160 --> 17:20.359
Hepu?

17:21.040 --> 17:22.319
Do you know the Cui's Pearl Farm?

17:23.599 --> 17:24.640
Yuchi,

17:25.839 --> 17:26.880
Duanwu

17:28.160 --> 17:29.200
is Yu Shi's daughter.

17:39.720 --> 17:40.800
Back then, I…

17:44.640 --> 17:45.840
Pass down the order.

17:45.920 --> 17:47.120
Make sure every guest is well treated.

17:47.920 --> 17:49.160
Yes, sir.

17:49.240 --> 17:52.040
Miss Duanwu, please come with me.

17:52.120 --> 17:52.960
Let me take you somewhere.

17:57.320 --> 17:58.800
Don't worry. Let's go.

18:00.160 --> 18:01.440
You guys settle in first.

18:02.840 --> 18:05.000
-Be careful.
-Please, this way.

18:13.040 --> 18:15.200
This is the room your father
used to stay in.

18:17.680 --> 18:19.040
Seeing it would bring back memories,

18:19.120 --> 18:20.360
so I haven't opened this door for years.

18:21.280 --> 18:24.760
Your father and I were both apprentices
in Gandhara jade carving.

18:25.440 --> 18:27.400
Later, I injured my hand

18:27.480 --> 18:29.000
and couldn't continue refining my craft.

18:30.080 --> 18:32.720
I could only assist our master
with odd jobs.

18:33.240 --> 18:35.880
But your father was very gifted.

18:35.960 --> 18:38.240
He went to Tang to showcase his talents,

18:38.760 --> 18:41.160
and there, he met your mother
at the Yan family.

18:42.360 --> 18:45.520
We parted ways
and hadn't seen each other for many years.

18:45.600 --> 18:47.080
Until later,

18:47.160 --> 18:49.080
when he accompanied
the Master of the Yan family

18:49.160 --> 18:50.320
on a treasure-guarding mission to Kang.

18:50.400 --> 18:51.960
He fell ill along the way

18:52.040 --> 18:53.680
and stayed here for a while.

18:54.400 --> 18:55.760
It was then

18:55.840 --> 18:57.680
that I found out your mother
was expecting.

18:58.640 --> 18:59.640
But I never imagined

19:00.360 --> 19:02.840
that your father and the convoy would be
attacked by the Black Dragon Bandits,

19:02.920 --> 19:03.880
perishing in the desert.

19:03.960 --> 19:05.800
Your mother also disappeared
without a trace.

19:07.000 --> 19:08.120
I never thought

19:09.800 --> 19:10.800
that years later,

19:11.520 --> 19:12.760
I'd see you here.

19:13.360 --> 19:14.760
It seems fated.

19:21.840 --> 19:24.720
This is the glasscraft technique
of our Yan family.

19:25.600 --> 19:26.640
Yan family glass?

19:35.320 --> 19:37.160
Thank you, Master Yuchi,

19:37.240 --> 19:38.720
for telling me all this.

19:38.800 --> 19:39.920
It's all in the past now.

19:40.000 --> 19:41.040
Let's not dwell on it.

19:41.720 --> 19:43.040
Keep her company here.

19:43.120 --> 19:44.320
I'll go make some preparations.

19:44.400 --> 19:45.960
Since you're here, stay a bit longer.

19:46.560 --> 19:47.760
I'll take good care of you.

19:47.840 --> 19:49.640
No need to bother.

19:49.720 --> 19:51.080
We'll only be here for a few days.

19:51.160 --> 19:53.120
It wasn't easy for you to come here.
Stay a bit longer.

19:53.200 --> 19:55.600
We have urgent business in Kang.

19:59.960 --> 20:01.040
You're going to Piti Spring?

20:02.440 --> 20:03.720
Yes.

20:03.800 --> 20:05.240
The Black Dragon Bandits are ruthless.

20:05.320 --> 20:07.800
Do you know how many convoys
have gone missing in recent years?

20:09.960 --> 20:11.120
We've already made up our minds.

20:12.200 --> 20:13.560
Recently, the Black Dragon Bandits

20:13.640 --> 20:16.160
have become even more violent,
committing all kinds of evil.

20:16.240 --> 20:18.600
They can block the Hexi route at will.

20:18.680 --> 20:21.320
So many souls have perished
by their blades,

20:21.400 --> 20:23.040
and countless people
have been left homeless,

20:23.120 --> 20:24.920
families destroyed and torn apart.

20:26.240 --> 20:27.760
The world isn't supposed to be this way.

20:29.800 --> 20:30.880
But, Yuchi,

20:31.840 --> 20:32.760
my mind is set.

20:35.240 --> 20:36.080
Keep her company.

20:44.760 --> 20:46.280
These are your father's things
from back then.

20:51.640 --> 20:52.920
I never met him,

20:53.440 --> 20:54.720
so I don't know

20:56.920 --> 20:59.000
what he was like when he was alive.

21:01.520 --> 21:02.800
But coming here today,

21:02.880 --> 21:03.840
I understand now

21:05.320 --> 21:07.520
why my mother taught me so much.

21:08.680 --> 21:09.560
It was for this.

21:09.640 --> 21:10.880
Your father

21:11.840 --> 21:13.520
was a very gentle and refined man

21:14.520 --> 21:15.440
and also very talented.

21:15.520 --> 21:18.000
When I was little,
I often went to his workshop to find him.

21:18.080 --> 21:20.640
He would always
show me his proud creations.

21:21.240 --> 21:22.280
And he was the only one

21:22.360 --> 21:23.760
who didn't treat me like a child.

21:23.840 --> 21:25.760
Later, when he was with your mother,

21:26.400 --> 21:27.520
they lived very happily together.

21:29.280 --> 21:30.600
So, that means,

21:31.760 --> 21:35.480
they fell in love
at the Yan family in Yangzhou?

21:35.560 --> 21:36.400
That's right.

21:36.480 --> 21:38.480
Back then, I always saw this scene,

21:38.560 --> 21:41.520
your father focusing on his jade work,

21:42.120 --> 21:45.040
and your mother quietly
sitting beside him,

21:45.120 --> 21:46.240
sewing new clothes for him.

21:58.440 --> 22:00.400
Perhaps my mother never imagined

22:02.840 --> 22:04.000
that I would end up here.

22:17.680 --> 22:20.520
If you hadn't been lucky enough
to meet me back then,

22:20.600 --> 22:21.800
by now,

22:21.880 --> 22:24.200
you'd probably have been buried
underground for years.

22:30.560 --> 22:32.480
You're still so reckless,

22:32.560 --> 22:34.320
knowing it's poisonous
but still taking risks.

22:34.920 --> 22:37.720
I think you just don't want to live long.

22:38.320 --> 22:39.760
You're too kind.

22:39.840 --> 22:41.600
The water in Black Dragon Pool is toxic.

22:41.680 --> 22:43.360
The medicine I gave you before

22:43.440 --> 22:45.080
can only suppress the poison,

22:45.160 --> 22:46.280
keeping it from flaring up.

22:54.400 --> 22:56.120
But to cure it completely

22:56.960 --> 22:57.800
is very difficult.

23:00.840 --> 23:02.240
Controlling it is good enough.

23:02.800 --> 23:03.640
But…

23:04.320 --> 23:05.480
maybe there's a way.

23:05.560 --> 23:06.680
What way?

23:06.760 --> 23:09.040
A few years ago,
when you treated the poison here,

23:10.160 --> 23:12.600
I got curious about its properties.

23:13.480 --> 23:16.760
As they say,
everything in the world has its counter.

23:16.840 --> 23:18.440
And now,

23:18.520 --> 23:21.320
I believe I've found an antidote
to neutralize the poison.

23:22.520 --> 23:23.800
Give me a little more time

23:24.480 --> 23:27.080
and maybe the poison inside you

23:27.160 --> 23:28.760
will gradually be dispelled.

23:30.280 --> 23:32.400
-Really?
-Believe it or not.

23:34.600 --> 23:35.800
Of course, I believe you.

23:41.280 --> 23:42.600
Only, the price…

23:42.680 --> 23:44.320
Price is no issue.

23:44.400 --> 23:45.880
I don't mind parting
with my gold and silver.

23:49.040 --> 23:51.720
A few years ago, when you came to me,

23:51.800 --> 23:52.840
you looked like someone

23:52.920 --> 23:54.840
ready to gamble with his life,

23:55.600 --> 23:56.720
but now,

23:57.720 --> 23:58.680
you actually value it.

24:05.320 --> 24:07.440
JEWELRY DESIGNS

24:17.040 --> 24:18.240
Duanwu,

24:18.320 --> 24:20.120
thank you for the hairpin you made for me.
I really like it.

24:20.960 --> 24:22.720
If you like it, I can make you another.

24:23.760 --> 24:24.600
-Thank you!
-Accountant Wei!

24:24.680 --> 24:26.360
-Give it back to me!
-Accountant Wei!

24:28.120 --> 24:29.720
-Mr. Cao went to great lengths
-How come you run so fast?

24:29.800 --> 24:31.720
to bring you this pot plant.

24:31.800 --> 24:33.920
Cao Da! You…

24:34.000 --> 24:35.720
What are you fussing about?

24:35.800 --> 24:37.640
I searched high and low
for something this cute

24:37.720 --> 24:39.880
to give to Accountant Wei.
Why make a fuss…

24:39.960 --> 24:40.920
You're giving her a cactus?

24:44.680 --> 24:45.520
Why?

24:46.120 --> 24:49.160
Do you think I'm interested in her?
How could that be?

24:49.240 --> 24:50.520
I'm not interested in you either.

24:51.320 --> 24:52.840
By the way, when will you pay back
what you owe the convoy?

24:52.920 --> 24:54.640
Accountant Wei, I was wrong.

24:54.720 --> 24:55.720
Please give me three more months.

24:56.320 --> 24:58.840
Three months?
Can you pay it back in three months?

24:58.920 --> 25:00.600
If I can't pay it back in three months,

25:00.680 --> 25:01.560
I'll pledge myself to you.

25:02.600 --> 25:04.800
Are you crazy?
What nonsense are you spouting?

25:04.880 --> 25:05.880
No, I meant…

25:05.960 --> 25:08.880
I'll find you a suitable groom,
so you can pledge yourself.

25:08.960 --> 25:10.800
-Thanks, but no thanks.
-Cao Da,

25:10.880 --> 25:11.720
with the people you know,

25:11.800 --> 25:13.680
how could any of them
be a match for our accountant?

25:14.560 --> 25:17.360
Exactly!
Your friends are all good-for-nothings!

25:17.440 --> 25:18.960
None of them are worthy of our accountant!

25:19.040 --> 25:20.160
Hurry up. Pay back the money!

25:20.680 --> 25:22.160
Leader…

25:24.880 --> 25:25.800
Don't give me that puppy-dog look.

25:26.640 --> 25:28.720
Accountant Wei, rules are rules.

25:28.800 --> 25:29.960
The convoy has its principles.

25:30.560 --> 25:32.560
Hand it over.
You used convoy money to go drinking.

25:32.640 --> 25:34.640
What's that about?
Hurry up. Hand over the money!

25:34.720 --> 25:35.720
-Yeah, pay up!
-Well…

25:35.800 --> 25:36.920
I really don't have any money on me.

25:37.000 --> 25:38.800
-If I had money, I would've paid you.
-Shrimp.

25:39.600 --> 25:41.600
-Stop scratching me!
-Shrimp.

25:41.680 --> 25:44.880
-I'm not scratching. Hold still!
-Hurry up!

25:45.560 --> 25:47.400
Alright, fine. Forget it.

25:48.520 --> 25:50.120
Master. Master.

25:50.720 --> 25:52.160
I just said,

25:52.240 --> 25:53.080
forget it.

25:53.160 --> 25:54.280
Forget what?

25:54.360 --> 25:55.960
Your debt to the convoy.

25:57.120 --> 25:59.520
Thank you, Master! I wish you and Leader

25:59.600 --> 26:02.680
harmony and happiness every day.

26:02.760 --> 26:04.200
-Are you cold?
-I'm alright.

26:07.800 --> 26:10.000
You're always together. Never enough, huh?

26:10.080 --> 26:12.240
Come on. Let's go. Time to eat!

26:12.760 --> 26:14.680
My treat. Let's go eat.

26:15.480 --> 26:17.320
I'm not going with you guys.

26:17.400 --> 26:20.000
-What's wrong?
-What's with you? You're acting strange.

26:20.880 --> 26:22.200
Strange?

26:22.280 --> 26:23.960
It's nothing.
The Master said to forget it.

26:26.280 --> 26:27.120
Something good's happening,

26:27.200 --> 26:28.800
but I can't tell you today.

26:29.960 --> 26:31.200
Why not?

26:33.080 --> 26:34.680
-Just can't tell you.
-Tell me quietly.

26:37.280 --> 26:38.280
Quietly tell you?

26:43.800 --> 26:45.400
It's that now I have you.

26:54.000 --> 26:56.200
Actually, there's something
I wanted to discuss with you.

26:56.800 --> 26:58.560
Why so serious? Discuss what?

26:58.640 --> 26:59.680
What's it about?

27:01.360 --> 27:02.640
Master Yuchi said

27:03.520 --> 27:06.400
going to Piti Spring
is extremely dangerous.

27:08.880 --> 27:10.480
If we take Shrimp and the others,

27:12.960 --> 27:14.120
I don't feel confident.

27:16.720 --> 27:18.680
Could we leave them here

27:19.440 --> 27:20.800
and pick them up when we return?

27:21.640 --> 27:22.840
You're thoughtful as always.

27:26.240 --> 27:27.120
But…

27:28.480 --> 27:29.960
I've actually been wanting to ask you.

27:32.560 --> 27:33.600
Will you agree

27:34.400 --> 27:35.640
to stay here with them

27:35.720 --> 27:36.640
and wait for my return?

27:40.960 --> 27:42.280
I can't let you take this risk alone.

27:42.960 --> 27:44.320
But this journey is full of danger,

27:45.360 --> 27:47.240
-even I'm not fully confident.
-Precisely because it's dangerous

27:47.320 --> 27:48.960
that I want to face it with you

27:49.760 --> 27:51.560
-Just this once, can you--
-Walk by your side.

27:55.840 --> 27:56.920
I'll be right by your side.

28:00.840 --> 28:02.400
Didn't I say before?

28:03.800 --> 28:05.120
I can be your shield.

28:13.400 --> 28:14.360
Alright then.

28:16.200 --> 28:17.040
In that case,

28:18.800 --> 28:20.040
I'll rely on you for protection.

28:52.000 --> 28:54.160
If we leave Shrimp and the others here,

28:55.840 --> 28:57.960
will Master Yuchi mind?

28:59.400 --> 29:00.400
What are you thinking?

29:01.040 --> 29:02.000
Don't worry.

29:02.080 --> 29:03.720
Yuchi is a good man,

29:03.800 --> 29:04.640
very kind.

29:05.640 --> 29:06.960
And I can tell

29:07.680 --> 29:09.040
he seems to like Shrimp quite a bit.

29:10.040 --> 29:11.080
Don't you like him too?

29:11.680 --> 29:14.200
If he were a bit quieter,
I'd like him even more.

29:14.280 --> 29:15.720
I'll go tell him.

29:20.640 --> 29:26.200
DUANWU

29:26.280 --> 29:27.320
Good!

29:28.640 --> 29:30.560
Almost as good as mine. Here,

29:30.640 --> 29:33.040
I'll reward you with a glass bead.

29:33.120 --> 29:34.600
Guess which hand it's in and it's yours.

29:36.360 --> 29:38.160
-Which hand?
-This one!

29:38.760 --> 29:40.000
Nope. Guess again.

29:40.080 --> 29:41.560
-Yuchi!
-It must be this one then.

29:41.640 --> 29:42.760
Oh, you're here!

29:43.480 --> 29:44.480
Shrimp.

29:46.360 --> 29:48.760
Duanwu, Master! Look! I wrote this!

29:50.080 --> 29:52.400
-You wrote it?
-The Master taught you?

29:54.680 --> 29:55.880
Thank you, Master!

29:55.960 --> 29:57.440
Shrimp has been with me for so long,

29:58.360 --> 29:59.400
but he's never learned to write.

30:00.600 --> 30:02.200
He's actually very smart.

30:06.560 --> 30:07.560
Shrimp,

30:08.320 --> 30:10.160
your writing is really good.

30:10.240 --> 30:12.800
But I feel like Mr. Cao
could write as well.

30:12.880 --> 30:14.760
He can't write. I'll have to teach him.

30:15.800 --> 30:16.840
Then go on.

30:17.520 --> 30:20.120
Well then, Master Yuchi,
I'll take my leave.

30:23.280 --> 30:25.080
Come, sit down, and let's talk.

30:26.040 --> 30:27.160
Come on.

30:30.960 --> 30:32.240
-Sit.
-sit.

30:32.320 --> 30:33.320
Come on.

30:38.040 --> 30:39.240
Yuchi.

30:39.840 --> 30:42.640
I… have a favor to ask.

30:43.760 --> 30:44.600
Just tell me.

30:47.760 --> 30:49.240
Duanwu and I were thinking

30:49.320 --> 30:50.640
this journey would surely be dangerous.

30:51.920 --> 30:52.960
So, we'd like

30:53.480 --> 30:55.800
to leave Shrimp and the others
in your care.

30:56.640 --> 30:58.240
We just wanted to check with you, Master.

30:58.320 --> 30:59.800
If it's too much trouble,

30:59.880 --> 31:01.080
we can find another way.

31:04.320 --> 31:05.560
To be honest,

31:06.200 --> 31:08.120
I've long grown tired

31:08.200 --> 31:09.360
of these old faces here.

31:09.440 --> 31:11.080
Your arrival

31:11.160 --> 31:13.400
has brought me so much joy and help.

31:13.480 --> 31:14.800
As long as you're willing,

31:15.440 --> 31:16.320
I'd be more than happy to help.

31:16.920 --> 31:19.080
That's great. Thank you.

31:21.720 --> 31:22.880
Zijing,

31:23.600 --> 31:24.880
don't think I'm nagging.

31:25.480 --> 31:27.840
Your parents' spirits above

31:27.920 --> 31:29.960
wouldn't want you
risking your life either.

31:32.120 --> 31:33.360
It's been so long already,

31:34.480 --> 31:36.080
when does revenge end?

31:39.280 --> 31:40.760
I understand everything you're saying.

31:42.360 --> 31:43.480
But this vengeance

31:44.800 --> 31:46.120
is not just for the Yan family.

31:47.520 --> 31:50.160
Langhuan Dockyard
may seem prosperous and peaceful,

31:50.840 --> 31:52.760
but many here have been torn
from their families.

31:53.360 --> 31:54.600
All of this

31:54.680 --> 31:56.040
is because of the Black Dragon Bandits.

31:59.960 --> 32:03.360
So, the day
the Black Dragon Bandits are gone,

32:04.400 --> 32:05.960
life will improve.

32:07.400 --> 32:10.600
Tang's tea, porcelain, and silk

32:11.480 --> 32:12.800
will flow to the Western Regions,

32:13.480 --> 32:15.320
and Western gemstones and jade

32:15.400 --> 32:16.960
will reach Tang.

32:17.040 --> 32:17.960
Then, Hexi

32:18.040 --> 32:20.040
will flourish like never before.

32:20.120 --> 32:21.800
All these years,

32:21.880 --> 32:23.320
you haven't changed a bit.

32:26.280 --> 32:27.240
Alright.

32:27.960 --> 32:28.800
Then, I wish

32:29.680 --> 32:31.680
you both a safe journey.

32:31.760 --> 32:33.000
May you return soon.

32:34.040 --> 32:35.960
I'm still waiting
to drink your wedding wine.

32:42.960 --> 32:43.960
Master,

32:46.080 --> 32:48.200
it's best not to tell Shrimp
and the others about this.

32:49.880 --> 32:51.680
Understood. Here,

32:53.040 --> 32:54.200
to your safe return.

33:04.040 --> 33:04.960
Duanwu!

33:06.080 --> 33:07.000
Duanwu!

33:37.880 --> 33:39.440
Were you trying to scare me?

33:40.640 --> 33:42.160
No, I wasn't.

33:42.680 --> 33:44.800
I just wanted you
to try this candied fruit.

33:47.480 --> 33:49.280
Thank you, Duanwu.

33:49.360 --> 33:50.440
Take it with you.

33:52.480 --> 33:53.520
By the way,

33:55.120 --> 33:56.000
did you make this?

33:56.080 --> 33:58.400
Why? Isn't it beautiful?

33:58.480 --> 34:01.400
-Really beautiful. You really made this?
-Look,

34:02.240 --> 34:04.040
there are two stars here, right?

34:04.120 --> 34:06.120
If you wrap them like this,

34:06.200 --> 34:07.480
they'll connect together.

34:13.400 --> 34:14.440
What are you thinking?

34:17.639 --> 34:20.199
They're just like you
and my brother-in-law.

34:23.840 --> 34:24.679
Shrimp,

34:26.159 --> 34:28.000
you're a little adult now.

34:28.080 --> 34:30.080
You have to look after Accountant Wei

34:30.159 --> 34:31.800
with Loud, Cao Da, and the others.

34:31.880 --> 34:33.199
By Master Yuchi's side,

34:33.280 --> 34:35.679
you'll need to do everything
and learn everything you can.

34:35.760 --> 34:37.639
-The more you learn, the better.
-But…

34:37.719 --> 34:39.320
writing is really hard.

34:40.080 --> 34:42.679
When Master Yuchi plays with me,

34:42.760 --> 34:44.000
he's really nice.

34:44.840 --> 34:47.840
But when he teaches me writing,
he's so strict.

34:47.920 --> 34:50.199
If I make even one mistake,
I get punished.

34:52.600 --> 34:54.120
Shrimp, you're the smartest.

34:54.800 --> 34:55.800
I know

34:55.880 --> 34:57.440
you'll learn a lot.

34:57.960 --> 34:59.880
You need to learn all the things

34:59.960 --> 35:01.240
you never learned before.

35:01.960 --> 35:02.920
Then, when the time comes,

35:04.200 --> 35:05.520
should we open a shop here?

35:07.000 --> 35:07.840
You like it here?

35:07.920 --> 35:09.040
Of course!

35:09.120 --> 35:13.880
Then, Mr. Cao, Loud, and I
will work for you.

35:15.000 --> 35:17.080
Lady Shiqi will carve jade for us,

35:18.720 --> 35:22.840
and Mr. Zhang will write the sign
for our shop.

35:23.640 --> 35:25.200
Accountant Wei will do the books,

35:25.960 --> 35:27.440
and the Master will greet guests outside.

35:28.720 --> 35:30.560
You'll draw the designs.

35:30.640 --> 35:33.320
That lineup would be grand!

35:34.160 --> 35:35.000
Let's do it your way.

35:35.600 --> 35:36.680
That sounds great!

35:43.800 --> 35:44.800
Shrimp,

35:45.800 --> 35:46.920
no matter where I am,

35:47.600 --> 35:48.880
I'll always find you.

36:03.440 --> 36:06.080
Our supplies have to pass
through this route.

36:06.920 --> 36:09.160
-Generals, you must guard it well.
-Yes, sir!

36:10.800 --> 36:12.480
General Pei,
Mr. Zhang requests an audience.

36:13.480 --> 36:14.520
Shijie!

36:15.480 --> 36:17.800
Jinran! What brings you to Hexi?

36:17.880 --> 36:20.200
It's been so long,
you're still as mighty as ever!

36:22.400 --> 36:23.440
I received a letter from Second Brother

36:24.040 --> 36:26.840
saying you're defending Hexi,
so I came specially.

36:28.200 --> 36:30.320
His Majesty has plans for Hexi

36:30.400 --> 36:32.040
and sent me here

36:32.120 --> 36:34.800
to reopen the long-closed Daqi Road.

36:39.360 --> 36:40.560
And this is?

36:42.360 --> 36:44.640
This is my friend, Lady Shiqi.

36:45.480 --> 36:46.360
Greetings, General Pei.

36:47.920 --> 36:49.520
She injured her hand earlier,

36:50.120 --> 36:52.200
and I heard your army
has a military doctor

36:52.280 --> 36:53.640
skilled in treating hand injuries,

36:53.720 --> 36:54.960
so I brought her here for help.

36:56.440 --> 36:57.840
Conditions in the army are tough.

36:57.920 --> 36:59.240
It's a lot to ask of you, Miss.

36:59.320 --> 37:01.440
Guards! Take the miss to Doctor Liu.

37:01.520 --> 37:03.760
-Yes, sir!
-Thank you, General Pei.

37:03.840 --> 37:04.920
This way, Miss.

37:06.400 --> 37:07.240
Over here.

37:09.840 --> 37:11.240
Jinran, this time, you're here

37:11.320 --> 37:12.480
not just for this young miss, right?

37:14.400 --> 37:18.000
Of course not.
I came here on behalf of Tang

37:18.080 --> 37:20.040
and of the people
along the Western trade routes

37:20.120 --> 37:21.600
to ask you to lend me troops

37:21.680 --> 37:23.000
to wipe out the Black Dragon Bandits.

37:23.080 --> 37:24.040
Wipe out the Black Dragon Bandits?

37:29.480 --> 37:30.600
This matter

37:31.640 --> 37:33.160
has always been a sore point for me.

37:34.320 --> 37:37.200
The Black Dragon Bandits are elusive,

37:37.720 --> 37:39.840
stationed beyond Tang's borders.

37:39.920 --> 37:41.320
If we rashly deploy troops,

37:41.880 --> 37:42.960
it could

37:44.000 --> 37:45.160
easily stir up border disputes.

37:45.240 --> 37:47.000
You're defending Hexi.

37:47.080 --> 37:48.440
Fighting bandits is part of that duty.

37:49.040 --> 37:51.400
The Black Dragon Bandits
often stay outside our borders,

37:51.480 --> 37:53.360
but they frequently raid our lands,

37:53.440 --> 37:55.720
attacking the trade routes.
The people suffer greatly.

37:55.800 --> 37:57.800
You can't just sit back.

37:57.880 --> 37:58.960
I know all of this.

37:59.600 --> 38:01.680
But there are rules in the military.

38:05.480 --> 38:06.520
Shijie,

38:07.480 --> 38:09.000
aren't rules made to be broken?

38:12.240 --> 38:13.080
Jinran,

38:13.840 --> 38:16.320
you must have another clever plan in mind.

38:17.360 --> 38:18.600
It's not much of a clever plan, really.

38:18.680 --> 38:20.520
If I can lure the Black Dragon Bandits out

38:21.480 --> 38:22.800
and it so happens

38:23.600 --> 38:24.960
that you are fighting bandits
at the border…

38:25.640 --> 38:28.080
Now that we happen to cross paths,
you won't just stand by, will you?

38:30.880 --> 38:33.360
Jinran, you always
have the craftiest ideas!

38:33.440 --> 38:34.720
Come on. Tell me your plan.

38:34.800 --> 38:35.800
Come on.

38:37.720 --> 38:39.600
Our men are assembled

38:39.680 --> 38:41.560
-and ready to move at any time.
-Good.

38:42.320 --> 38:43.800
What about Mr. Zhang?

38:43.880 --> 38:44.840
There won't be any issues
on his end, right?

38:45.440 --> 38:47.240
He's already arrived at Pei Shijie's camp.

38:47.320 --> 38:50.280
There shouldn't be any problems.

38:51.800 --> 38:53.480
What about supplies and weapons?

38:54.800 --> 38:56.920
Don't worry. Everything will be arranged.

39:00.320 --> 39:01.560
I'll go make further preparations.

39:07.200 --> 39:08.360
It's alright.

39:09.680 --> 39:10.800
Don't worry.

39:12.000 --> 39:12.920
With you here,

39:13.720 --> 39:14.680
I have no worries.

39:18.280 --> 39:19.240
By the way,

39:20.320 --> 39:21.480
I wanted to discuss something with you.

39:23.560 --> 39:25.720
Let me hold onto the blood-stained pearl.

39:26.320 --> 39:29.240
The blood-stained pearl is the very thing
the Black Dragon Bandits covet.

39:29.880 --> 39:31.480
Keeping it with you is dangerous.

39:32.080 --> 39:33.600
Plus, this time,

39:33.680 --> 39:35.520
we're using it to lure them out.

39:49.560 --> 39:50.600
I don't know

39:51.720 --> 39:54.040
what's so special
about this blood-stained pearl.

39:55.280 --> 39:56.320
Why is everyone so eager to possess it?

39:58.960 --> 40:00.080
Inside the blood-stained pearl

40:01.040 --> 40:03.040
is a map to the treasures of Gulistan.

40:06.480 --> 40:07.720
Gulistan?

40:08.560 --> 40:09.400
Yes.

40:10.240 --> 40:12.680
Back then,
Kang discovered this vein of ore,

40:13.320 --> 40:16.080
intending to present it to Tang
through the Apsaras statue.

40:16.760 --> 40:19.080
But word got out unexpectedly.

40:20.680 --> 40:22.040
So, what the Black Dragon Bandits covet

40:22.960 --> 40:24.720
is actually the treasure of Gulistan.

40:32.760 --> 40:34.480
But if you keep the blood-stained pearl,

40:37.160 --> 40:38.320
won't you be in danger too?

40:39.880 --> 40:40.960
Don't worry.

40:41.560 --> 40:42.440
I told you,

40:43.120 --> 40:43.960
everything is arranged.

40:49.880 --> 40:50.960
Here, Jinran.

40:51.040 --> 40:52.760
I toast to you and Master Yan.

40:52.840 --> 40:55.240
You two, full of courage and wisdom,

40:55.320 --> 40:56.640
risk your lives for the peace

40:56.720 --> 40:59.000
of our borders. I truly admire you both!

40:59.600 --> 41:01.680
We still need your strong support

41:01.760 --> 41:04.360
to restore peace
for the people at the frontier.

41:04.440 --> 41:05.520
That's for sure.

41:05.600 --> 41:06.680
Come. Cheers!

41:14.480 --> 41:16.360
I heard from Du Ming

41:16.960 --> 41:19.760
that you and Master Yan
both fancy the same young lady.

41:20.280 --> 41:23.320
But in the end, she went with Master Yan.

41:24.160 --> 41:25.720
Tell me, Fourth Brother,

41:25.800 --> 41:27.280
how did you lose to him?

41:27.360 --> 41:30.440
That Master Yan…
What's so remarkable about him?

41:32.000 --> 41:33.240
That Master Yan…

41:36.360 --> 41:37.200
He's actually quite ordinary.

41:39.400 --> 41:40.720
It's just that…

41:43.200 --> 41:44.240
she's truly unique.

41:47.200 --> 41:49.320
In my whole life, I've never met

41:49.400 --> 41:51.160
a woman so extraordinary.

41:58.080 --> 42:01.840
I get it. A good woman
can't resist a persistent man.

42:02.360 --> 42:05.280
You're just too reserved,
too worried about saving face.

42:05.360 --> 42:07.760
If you like her, just tell her directly.

42:07.840 --> 42:09.640
She definitely won't turn you down.

42:09.720 --> 42:10.760
I did tell her,

42:11.920 --> 42:13.160
and she rejected me.

42:15.320 --> 42:16.320
Duanwu,

42:17.080 --> 42:18.240
it's time to set off.

42:23.400 --> 42:24.360
Duanwu?

42:31.720 --> 42:32.760
Kang Ju!
